---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | PERIFLOW" description="PERIFLOW privacy policy — how we collect, use and protect your information.">
  <section class="bg-navy-950 text-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-lg text-slate-300">Last updated: August 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="prose prose-slate mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>When you submit an inquiry on this website, we collect the information you provide: name, email address, company name, product interest, quantity and message content. We also collect basic technical data such as your IP address and browser type for security and analytics purposes.</p>

      <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to your inquiries and provide quotations</li>
        <li>To communicate about your orders, samples and projects</li>
        <li>To improve our website and product offerings</li>
        <li>To prevent fraud and ensure website security</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not sell, rent or trade your personal information to third parties.</p>

      <h2>3. Email Communications</h2>
      <p>Inquiry messages are sent to our business email address for processing. We may contact you regarding your inquiry. You may opt out of any non-essential communications at any time by replying to the email.</p>

      <h2>4. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>We retain inquiry records as long as necessary to serve our business relationship and comply with legal obligations.</p>

      <h2>5. Cookies</h2>
      <p>This website uses minimal cookies for essential functionality. We do not use third-party advertising cookies.</p>

      <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data by contacting us at <a href="mailto:cj226144@gmail.com">cj226144@gmail.com</a>.</p>

      <h2>7. Contact</h2>
      <p>For privacy questions, contact: <a href="mailto:cj226144@gmail.com">cj226144@gmail.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
